Base URL from the login: https://mis.kotaksecurities.com
Base URL when the login names none: https://gw-napi.kotaksecurities.com
Place skip reason with a sid: None
Place skip reason without a sid: its login in Redis carries no sid
Cancel problem without a sid: kotak has no sid in its login in Redis
Session headers: {'neo-fin-key': 'neotradeapi', 'Auth': 'example-kotak-token', 'Sid': 'example-sid'}
Place:
{
  "form": {
    "jData": "{\"es\": \"nse_cm\", \"ts\": \"RELIANCE-EQ\", \"qt\": \"10\", \"pr\": \"2500.05\", \"tp\": \"0\", \"dq\": \"0\", \"pc\": \"MIS\", \"tt\": \"B\", \"pt\": \"L\", \"rt\": \"DAY\", \"mp\": \"0\", \"pf\": \"N\", \"am\": \"NO\", \"rm\": \"kotak01\"}"
  },
  "method": "POST",
  "url": "https://mis.kotaksecurities.com/quick/order/rule/ms/place"
}
